[6;1H[49CA black and foreboding
[49Ccastle looms over the
[49Chorizon. Its cold, black
[49Cstone walls are decorated
[49Cwith complex symbols and
[49Carchaic runes of long
[49Cforgotten language.
[49C
[49C(Stab RETURN key)
[0;1H[0C[30m[0C[37m[6;1H[6;1H[49C                          
