[6;1H[49CA shape of white mist
[49Cslowly thickens to human
[49Cshape. A transparent image
[49Cof a beautiful woman
[49Cforms in front of you.
[49C
[49C(Decapitate RETURN key)
[0;1H[0C[30m[0C[37m[6;1H[6;1H[49C                          
[49C                          
[49C                          
[49C                          
[49C                          
[49C                          
[49C                          
