[49C                          
[49C                          
[49C                          
[6;1H[49C- Do not be afraid,
[49Cadventurers. I am Jaara,
[49Cguardian of the gate.
[49CBaron Ydarg has imprisoned
[49Cme here forever. I can't
[49Churt you, just stop you
[49Cfrom entering if you don't
[49Chave the Silver Key!
[49C
[49C(Smash RETURN key)
[0;1H[0C[30m[0C[37m[6;1H[6;1H[49C                          
