[6;1H[49CYou show the Silver Key to
[49Cthe ghost. Her eyes widen,
[49Cas she sees it. She smiles
[49Cand waves her hand towards
[49Cthe drawbridge. It falls
[49Cto the ground with a
[49Cresounding KRASH. Jaara
[49Cslowly fades away until
[49Cnothing remains.
[49C
