[49C                          
[6;1H[49CA mage imprisoned in a
[49Cfiery sphere offers to
[49Copen trapdoor at the top
[49Cof the stairs if you
[49Cgive him an item of power!
[49CHe also offers to teleport
[49Cyou out of the castle,
[49Cfor free.
[49C
[49C(Slash RETURN key)
[0;1H[0C[30m[0C[37m[6;1H[6;1H[49C                          
